+# Presentation — Current
+
+## Social frame
+
+Logical geometry remains 540×960:
+
+```text
+HEADER 0..144
+BODY   144..816
+FOOTER 816..960
+```
+
+Current C11-C physical manufacturing profile is 720×1280 / 30 FPS.
+
+## Editorial
+
+- Header: up to 3 lines, Inter Bold, shared Matrix typography metric.
+- Footer: up to 3 lines, Noto Sans Mono.
+- Header and Footer separators are visible.
+- Editorial text is presentation-only.
+
+## Visual Loop
+
+20–23 seconds and loop-safe in the current review profile.
+
+## Visual Drill
+
+```text
+PRE_ROLL 3 s
+GAME
+END_CTA 3 s
+```
+
+Tracking uses 21 s gameplay; Saccade, Pursuit and Peripheral Scan use 17 s gameplay.
+
+## Longform
+
+180 seconds. Existing rendered family content is composed with visual dissolve continuity between chapters, never through black; black is reserved for the final fade.
